# Runtime task workspaces (created per-task at run time; harnesses/ stays a
# pure, immutable template — mutable state lives here instead). Both
# backends have their own — server/ and server-kotlin/ are kept at feature
# parity (see AGENTS.md) and each maintains its own workspace root.
server/workspaces/
server-kotlin/workspaces/

# Claude Code's own per-session runtime lock for this repo, not project
# config — recreated automatically, nothing to track.
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
